 "remarks": "Beautiful Apartment-All Utilities Included! This beautifully designed unit offers a private entrance, high ceilings, and a comfortable, thoughtfully designed layout. Enjoy your own private outdoor area-perfect for grilling, relaxing, and chillin'-along with convenient off-street parking. Even better, all utilities are included in the rent, including gas, water, electricity, snow and lawn care, making monthly budgeting simple and predictable. The apartment features all-new modern appliances and amenities, including: Full-size electric stove and oven, Microwave, Dishwasher, In-unit washer & dryer, Air conditioning, High ceilings, Private entrance, Private outdoor space, Off-street parking, Recessed Lighting, Celling Fans, and again, All utilities are included! This is a rare opportunity to enjoy the privacy and feel of a single-family home, while having the convenience of utilities included and everything you need right at your fingertips. Move-in ready and truly turnkey-this one checks all the boxes! A super-convenient commuter location, just minutes from both the Merritt Parkway and I-95, as well as the Metro-North train station. Enjoy easy access to shopping, dining, and everyday essentials, with everything you could need just five minutes away.",
